## Validation Tools and Commands

### Build Commands
```bash
# Build benchmark server
cd /home/node/naso
cargo build --package bench_runner --release

# Compile benchmark binary
/tmp/cargo-target/release/bench_runner
```

### Test Commands
```bash
# wrk benchmark testing
wrk -t4 -c100 -d10s http://127.0.0.1:8099/

# Benchmark validation script
./benchmark.sh
```

